      "rationale": "Kuma in fɔcogo ye: 'a bolo digi dumunubolan kɔnɔ' — a bɛ dondonbagenya jira; bayɛlɛmali caman bɛ 'a kɔnɔdugu' ta (KJV 'bosom') nka sɛbɛnni kɔrɔ ye dumunubolan ye."
